// rts/data/scripts/ui_health.json: the player-interface health bar and death ring script (rts/docs/specs/player_interface_2.md section 4, check 4). Parsed by Rts.Sim.Data.CommandScript in the Unity SimulationHost (Script Relative Path scripts/ui_health.json) and the headless harness (--script rts/data/scripts/ui_health.json). ui_sandbox.json plus three Skai Talon Archers that attack one Water-owned Talon Archer at tick 20 with no player input, so a damaged unit's health bar and a unit-killed ring appear in the first seconds. Slot 0 is Skai (local player), slot 1 is Water.
